.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:101:| R55 | C1 (category), C2 (M2, M18 and the figures built on them) |
.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:285:| A café banks its takings in cash every day | Each deposit counts as trading receipts and M18 shows the cash total. Deposits at or above the limit and months above the cash share are flagged and listed first | R55, R14, R15 |
.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:286:| An owner pays personal cash in to lift turnover | It counts as trading receipts (D31). A deposit at or above the limit, a cash-heavy month, or cash paid in soon after a similar withdrawal is flagged; the underwriter moves it to director funding with a reason | R14, R17, R55 |
